# Product Boost Keywords

## Overview

Keywords used to boost products in featured sections (جدیدترین ها, تخفیف های وسوسه انگیز). Products whose title contains any of these (case-insensitive) appear first.

## Source of Truth

`apps/frontend/src/constants/productKeywords.ts`

```typescript
export const PRODUCT_BOOST_KEYWORDS = ["G"] as const;
```

## Expanding the Keyword List

1. Add new keywords to the `PRODUCT_BOOST_KEYWORDS` array.
2. No other code changes needed—API filter and client-side checks use this list automatically.

Example:
```typescript
export const PRODUCT_BOOST_KEYWORDS = ["G", "new", "جدید"] as const;
```

## Related Code

- **API filter**: `buildTitleKeywordFilter()` in `productKeywords.ts` — builds Strapi `$containsi` filter (single: `filters[Title][$containsi]=X`; multiple: `filters[$or][n][Title][$containsi]=X`)
- **Client-side check**: `productTitleMatchesKeywords()` in `utils/product.ts` — returns true if product title contains any keyword (case-insensitive)
- **Usage**: homepage.ts (جدیدترین ها, تخفیف), plp/page.tsx, PLP/List.tsx

## Backward Compatibility

`productTitleHasG` is kept as an alias for `productTitleMatchesKeywords` for existing call sites.
